### FCG Fase 2 - roteiro manual dos fluxos (REST Client do VS Code ou HTTP Client do Rider)
### Execute na ordem. Com Kubernetes, faca port-forward para as mesmas portas.

@users = http://localhost:5101
@catalog = http://localhost:5102
@payments = http://localhost:5103
@email = video@fcg.dev
@password = Senha@123

### 1. Cadastro (gera UserCreatedEvent -> e-mail de boas-vindas no log da NotificationsAPI)
POST {{users}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Usuario do Video", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. Login do usuario
# @name login
POST {{users}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Login do administrador (seed)
# @name admin
POST {{users}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@cloudgames.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Catalogo (preco efetivo com promocao)
# @name games
GET {{catalog}}/api/v1/games

@gameId = {{games.response.body.$[0].id}}

### 5. Compra aprovada: pedido (202 Pending -> OrderPlacedEvent)
# @name order
POST {{catalog}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gameId": "{{gameId}}" }

@orderId = {{order.response.body.orderId}}

### 6. Situacao do pedido (Completed apos o PaymentProcessedEvent)
GET {{catalog}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Pagamento na PaymentsAPI
GET {{payments}}/api/v1/payments/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Biblioteca do usuario
GET {{catalog}}/api/v1/library
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Compra rejeitada: administrador cadastra jogo acima do limite (R$ 300)
# @name expensive
POST {{catalog}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Jogo Premium do Video", "description": "Acima do limite de aprovacao", "genre": "Acao", "price": 399.90, "releaseDate": null }

### 10. Pedido do jogo caro
# @name rejected
POST {{catalog}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gameId": "{{expensive.response.body.id}}" }

### 11. Pedido Rejected com motivo
GET {{catalog}}/api/v1/orders/{{rejected.response.body.orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
